  "rejection": {
    "code": "E_CONTRACT",
    "timing": "creation",
    "notDrawTime": true
  },
  "invariants": [
    "ABI 1 fixes vertex locations 0, 1, 2 and instance matrix locations 3, 4, 5, 6.",
    "TANGENT, COLOR_0, JOINTS_0, WEIGHTS_0 and TEXCOORD_1 are not part of ABI 1.",
    "Normal mapping in ABI 1 uses the derivative tangent frame (04 §5.13).",
    "Skinned and morph layouts must be new layout ids with a RENDERER_ABI_VERSION bump; they must never shift ABI-1 locations.",
    "Index format is uint16 for at most 65535 vertices and uint32 otherwise."
  ]
